# a vase SILHOUETTE for `revolve`: a closed shell contour on the x >= 0
# half-plane, x read as the radius and y as the height. Swept about Y it becomes
# a hollow vase 1.6 units tall and 1.5 wide.
version 1
fill 1 1 1 1
contour 10
v 0.5 0
v 0.7 0.3
v 0.55 0.8
v 0.75 1.3
v 0.6 1.6
v 0.45 1.6
v 0.6 1.3
v 0.4 0.8
v 0.55 0.3
v 0.35 0
